  "uuid": "ab99dd66-9cc5-44ac-a9bc-9235143f511c",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "6fdd5031-839e-400c-b912-83efac925e7c",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "8bb8772a-12e0-1090-f26a-5c29eb529350",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The University continues to widen and deepen its impact on Tanzanian society by venturing into areas as diverse as agriculture, afforestation, business development, community cohesion, language skills and sport through its Community Outreach Centre (COC) in Arusha.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Launched in 2018, the COC is a hub for the local community that houses state-of-the-art educational, teaching, healthcare and recreational facilities. To date, the centre has empowered 28,000 people to launch their own businesses, adopt farming techniques that have enhanced their food security and learn key skills that have raised their quality of life.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
